    <string name="intro_title">Welcome to StickLab</string>
    <string name="intro_text">StickLab adjusts the stick deadzone and lets the stick LEDs follow the colors on screen.\n\n• Works only on the AYN Odin 3. It uses a system service that is built into the device, no root needed.\n• For Ambilight, Android gives the app a tiny live copy of the screen (96×54 pixels). Nothing is saved or sent anywhere.\n• Use at your own risk.</string>
